{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hequan-e-o197","title":"评曰山越难安孙权卑词魏氏诸臣克宁内难","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-c0f30d0448becd47d08c","label":"正文·评（陈寿评曰）","text":"陈寿总评五臣：山越难安易动，孙权不遑外御、卑词魏氏，诸臣克宁内难；吕岱清恪在公、周鲂谲略多奇、钟离牧蹈长者之规、全琮有当世之才而不检奸子","evidence":["hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0051","role":"评四臣克宁内难","evidence":["hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153","source_order":[60,428,0],"order":10699}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0051","name":"陈寿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-08aa3315eec1e30f8b1c","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：山越好为叛乱，难安易动；是以孙权不遑外御，卑词魏氏〖1〗。凡此诸臣，皆克宁内难，绥静邦域者也。吕岱清恪在公。周鲂谲略多奇。钟离牧蹈长者之规。全琮有当世之才〖2〗，贵重于时；然不检奸子〖3〗，获讥毁名云","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":427,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
